    "item":  [
                 {
                     "name":  "Get Paged Gyms",
                     "event":  [
                                   {
                                       "listen":  "test",
                                       "script":  {
                                                      "exec":  [
                                                                   "pm.test(\"Status code is 200\", function () {",
                                                                   "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                                                                   "});",
                                                                   "var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                                                                   "if (jsonData \u0026\u0026 jsonData.data \u0026\u0026 jsonData.data.items \u0026\u0026 jsonData.data.items.length \u003e 0) {",
                                                                   "    pm.variables.set(\"gymId\", jsonData.data.items[0].id);",
                                                                   "}"
                                                               ],
                                                      "type":  "text/javascript"
                                                  }
                                   }
                               ],
                     "request":  {
                                     "description":  "### Endpoint Overview\n\nFetches a paginated list of gyms with dynamic sorting and filtering.\n\n---\n\n### Available Domain Attributes \u0026 Filter Reference\n\n| Attribute Name | Data Type | Filter Support | Description / Allowed Values |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| `Id` | `int` | Exact | Unique Identifier |\n| `Name` | `string` | Searchable | Gym name |\n| `Description` | `string` | - | Optional description |\n| `PhoneNumber` | `string` | - | Contact phone |\n| `Email` | `string` | - | Contact email |\n| `AddressLine1` | `string` | - | Main address line |\n| `AddressLine2` | `string` | - | Secondary address line |\n| `City` | `string` | - | City |\n| `State` | `string` | - | State |\n| `PostalCode` | `string` | - | Postal/Zip code |\n| `Latitude` | `decimal` | Between | Geographical latitude |\n| `Longitude` | `decimal` | Between | Geographical longitude |\n| `Status` | `Enum (int)` | Exact | `1` = Active, `2` = Inactive, etc. |\n| `FileUrl` | `string` | - | URL to gym logo/image |\n| `CreatedOn` | `DateTime` | Between | ISO format creation date |\n| `CreatedById` | `int` | Exact | Creator ID |\n| `IsActive` | `bool` | Exact | Active status |\n\n---\n\n### Filter Usage Guide (For Request Body)\n\n- **Exact Filters (`exactFilters`):** Pass attribute name with array of string/enum values. Example: `\"exactFilters\": { \"Status\": [\"1\"] }`\n- **Between Filters (`betweenFilters`):** Pass attribute name with `min` and `max`. Example: `\"betweenFilters\": { \"Latitude\": { \"min\": \"30.0\", \"max\": \"31.0\" } }`",
                                     "method":  "POST",
                                     "header":  [
                                                    {
                                                        "key":  "Content-Type",
                                                        "value":  "application/json"
                                                    }
                                                ],
                                     "body":  {
                                                  "mode":  "raw",
                                                  "raw":  "{\n  \"pageNumber\": 1,\n  \"pageSize\": 10,\n  \"orderBy\": \"Id\",\n  \"orderDirection\": \"asc\",\n  \"filters\": {\n    \"betweenFilters\": {},\n    \"exactFilters\": {}\n  }\n}"
                                              },
                                     "url":  {
                                                 "raw":  "{{baseUrl}}/api/Gym",
                                                 "host":  [
                                                              "{{baseUrl}}"
                                                          ],
                                                 "path":  [
                                                              "api",
                                                              "Gym"
                                                          ]
                                             }
                                 },
                     "response":  [

